WEBVTT

00:09:29.316 --> 00:09:32.236
Now, some people will probably tell you

00:09:32.236 --> 00:09:35.196
that a small country
cannot make a big difference.

00:09:36.396 --> 00:09:37.796
I beg to differ.

00:09:38.716 --> 00:09:41.836
When a young man like Henrik

00:09:41.876 --> 00:09:44.836
could make a difference
for a whole country,

00:09:44.876 --> 00:09:47.876
why not also believe
that a country like Denmark

00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:49.996
can make a difference for a whole world?

00:09:50.916 --> 00:09:53.556
We can't do it alone, but we can do a lot.

00:09:53.996 --> 00:09:55.516
By innovating,

00:09:55.556 --> 00:09:58.796
by creating new technology
and new solutions,

00:09:58.836 --> 00:10:02.436
by exploiting something
that is much bigger than ourselves,